# Terraform — never commit local provider cache, state, or tfvars (may hold secrets)
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# DO commit `.terraform.lock.hcl` (provider version/hash lock — reproducibility).
